				<wikidot:authorName>Bland</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>663362</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Beautiful.</p> <p>Also it makes one think - what will you leave behind (and not just your name carved in a drawer)?</p> <blockquote> <p>&quot;So that the movers will know where to take it,&quot; he said, doing the same for a couple of <strong>desks</strong> and an office chair.</p> </blockquote> <p>Probably should be cabinets or tables, unless she needs a LOT of desks.</p> 
				 	]]>
